{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A turn-based strategy game inspired by classic tabletop games.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your unit groups on game boards set in the fantasy world of Korsak. Lead them to victory by capturing fortresses and engaging in strategic battles. And remember: your units are all you have. Every action is decisive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/21e485951edd11f166509cdca2309413.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/21e485951edd11f166509cdca2309413.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/21e485951edd11f166509cdca2309413.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/6f8f0ccf60d2cabecffc53d1471f2da9.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/6f8f0ccf60d2cabecffc53d1471f2da9.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/6f8f0ccf60d2cabecffc53d1471f2da9.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In campaign mode, you can configure and upgrade your unit groups through a progression system based on development trees and experience to earn honors. You will play missions with various objectives and rewards. Some secondary objectives will pose a significant challenge, requiring you to progress further to complete them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/e65149acfc067fa4e10bbc67a0dc3c72.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/e65149acfc067fa4e10bbc67a0dc3c72.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/e65149acfc067fa4e10bbc67a0dc3c72.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In skirmish and multiplayer modes, you can play with the various available factions on diverse game boards against computer-controlled or online opponents. Capture fortresses to obtain upgrades. Use the terrain to improve your groups' stats and, above all, use strategy to keep your units safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/22e673b76ff33e0c77f6e79e84e786f6.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/22e673b76ff33e0c77f6e79e84e786f6.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/22e673b76ff33e0c77f6e79e84e786f6.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat between unit groups is based on direct attacks and counterattacks, occurring at range or in melee. You must design your groups for each situation and use the formation system to improve your hit chance or decrease that of your opponent. The mechanics are simple. The most important factor is how and where you position your units before engaging in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/b0c01267a55293aacf2f1b32cabcef59.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/b0c01267a55293aacf2f1b32cabcef59.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/b0c01267a55293aacf2f1b32cabcef59.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/954439211447526a15a06e5b5ebffb8123428b89.jpg"},{"name":"No Problem!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/e6dcb87a852189a3672318e9fa89b3616b49dea6.jpg"},{"name":"Full Roster!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/0f8f7f0f178044f53262c6184fe00ccbbd65ac05.jpg"},{"name":"All At Your Command!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/cc7ffbeb106c2e9e40e13ce46b6e568b822cf96c.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/acb1c81cd44dda4fbc0702d037f8aeed75013534.jpg"},{"name":"Honored Group","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/a07ab9ebd6c996fdcf16f8e79ae8853e9000c5e5.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Honor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/a58fbd8e0f24681d1c6f858d0d326d959f9417e3.jpg"},{"name":"Untouchable!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/f474c571dab952d9dc3212383dbbcfe1810ed7d1.jpg"},{"name":"You Did It!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/c9c9338f23ba09901dcfd14b44af7a0c74c4d950.jpg"},{"name":"The Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866000/756635bcae863074fbf79e230011690064ad4979.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866000?t=1772816406","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/dd739a13148912ca4ac2d26a1a2d68fd5c8a71a9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772816406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/a4e8e260ed610a42cdf49a0a94b762c0b775608d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772816406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/a4e8e260ed610a42cdf49a0a94b762c0b775608d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772816406","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4064360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A turn-based strategy game inspired by classic tabletop games.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your unit groups on game boards set in the fantasy world of Korsak. Lead them to victory by capturing fortresses and engaging in strategic battles. And remember: your units are all you have. Every action is decisive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/21e485951edd11f166509cdca2309413.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/21e485951edd11f166509cdca2309413.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/21e485951edd11f166509cdca2309413.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/6f8f0ccf60d2cabecffc53d1471f2da9.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/6f8f0ccf60d2cabecffc53d1471f2da9.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/6f8f0ccf60d2cabecffc53d1471f2da9.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In campaign mode, you can configure and upgrade your unit groups through a progression system based on development trees and experience to earn honors. You will play missions with various objectives and rewards. Some secondary objectives will pose a significant challenge, requiring you to progress further to complete them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/e65149acfc067fa4e10bbc67a0dc3c72.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/e65149acfc067fa4e10bbc67a0dc3c72.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/e65149acfc067fa4e10bbc67a0dc3c72.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In skirmish and multiplayer modes, you can play with the various available factions on diverse game boards against computer-controlled or online opponents. Capture fortresses to obtain upgrades. Use the terrain to improve your groups' stats and, above all, use strategy to keep your units safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/22e673b76ff33e0c77f6e79e84e786f6.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/22e673b76ff33e0c77f6e79e84e786f6.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/22e673b76ff33e0c77f6e79e84e786f6.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat between unit groups is based on direct attacks and counterattacks, occurring at range or in melee. You must design your groups for each situation and use the formation system to improve your hit chance or decrease that of your opponent. The mechanics are simple. The most important factor is how and where you position your units before engaging in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/b0c01267a55293aacf2f1b32cabcef59.poster.avif?t=1772816406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/b0c01267a55293aacf2f1b32cabcef59.webm?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/extras/b0c01267a55293aacf2f1b32cabcef59.mp4?t=1772816406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["EdenDev Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866000/c6ab00f754add669ed4604b27475639e9157fadf/header.jpg?t=1772816406","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866000/756751559/7eed68a09b11a8eb4190ef2374594b102dbdfd6f/1770998490/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771000419","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866000/756751559/7eed68a09b11a8eb4190ef2374594b102dbdfd6f/1770998490/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771000419","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866000/756751559/7eed68a09b11a8eb4190ef2374594b102dbdfd6f/1770998490/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771000419","id":257286682,"name":"Release announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257286682/82b15e754671a4294e71c2fbb01d36d7d77dc7e1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771000419"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866000/1751036361/cf88d7a037f774b932a45ee8516202ff470fc1e3/1766174887/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771000420","dash_h264":"https://video.aka